        <mxCell id="wallet-note" value="Connection Semantics&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Connection provides a wallet address and signing capability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Disconnection only clears local connection state. NFTs, funds, and on-chain approvals remain.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A MetaMask account or chain change disconnects the frontend and requests reconnection.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If minting starts without a wallet, connect first, then click Mint again." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#162b42;strokeWidth=1.6;shape=note;size=18;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#c5d1df;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
